# TAIC project

Read the repository `AGENTS.md` before changing code. It is the canonical project
instruction file and covers:

- `tests/shared/` vs `tests/backends/<id>/` vs `tests/support/`
- the safe offline test command
- GPU and paid-LLM permission rules
- backend/target layout and the no-shim rule.

The shared skills are available in `.cursor/skills/` and `.agents/skills/`:
`harness-feedback` and `taic-tools`. They are symlinks to the canonical
`.pi/skills/harness-feedback` and
`taic/flows/kernel_once/skills/taic-tools`; do not copy or fork their text.

Before committing, show the proposed commit body. Preserve unrelated changes.
